    {
      "id": "UgwABnKEwQeE7tjlTVl4AaABAg",
      "author": "@wa33785",
      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mSxB8uujKsQuk60veFdRWTDOkdWAAkyyKdgp8NfO4=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "呉市街からとびしま海道の末端は今治市岡村島（愛媛県）まで。岡村島の直ぐ隣島中ノ島（呉）は広島県。岡村島は橋で同子大下島と同大下島を通して大三島のしまなみ海道に繋がっていない。",
      "likeCount": 2,
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T16:40:19Z",
      "replyCount": 2,
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "UgwABnKEwQeE7tjlTVl4AaABAg.AbcjuHDym7NAbxQrprOZjr",
          "author": "@edogawasullivan9191",
          "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nnj-IpGkJ4azz-BNPsLgmgWsl5ZGRqYS20C_f3iXk=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
          "text": "あまり時間がかかったら岡村島の人が帰属を広島県に鞍替えさせてくれ！とおこかも",
          "likeCount": 0,
          "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T17:29:16Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "UgwABnKEwQeE7tjlTVl4AaABAg.AbcjuHDym7NAbeBSNUx1r3",
          "author": "@necoyasiki942",
          "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lFFW-nj60JfhTG590s75U0dWxzJiGsU07Mq2tqA7-t2yj2XpI=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
          "text": "島と島の間隔が短いから、架橋の難易度が全然違う。岡島から先、どこにも繋げていない。",
          "likeCount": 2,
